{"ok": true, "summary": "The model represents a four-way reversing valve with a Ø34 × 110 mm main body, an upper D connection, and lower E, S, C connections at 22 mm pitch. A Ø14 × 45 mm pilot assembly connects to both body ends through two Ø3 mm capillaries. Three selectable configurations compare the current 3 mm copper wall, a 2.2 mm copper wall, and a 2 mm stainless wall. Unspecified dimensions are assumed: connection tubes extend 30 mm with 1 mm walls, capillaries have 0.5 mm walls, and end closures match the body wall. Costs include the perforated main shell, end closures, four copper connections, and copper capillaries; pilot internals, joining, and processing are excluded. Sectioning exposes an illustrative cavity and slider, not a validated switching mechanism.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Four-way reversing valve</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#25303a}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:15px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\nbutton,select{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:3px}\n#comparison{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;max-width:540px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;font-size:12px}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}\ntd,th{padding:6px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #dedede}\ntd:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}\n.note{font-size:11px;max-width:490px;margin-top:6px;color:#59616b}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:12px}\n@media(max-width:600px){#comparison{left:12px;font-size:11px}td,th{padding:4px}}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Four-way reversing valve</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Main body Ø34 × 110 mm · E/S/C pitch 22 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">D/E/S/C Ø12.7 · exposed length 30 · wall 1 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Pilot Ø14 × 45 · capillaries Ø3 / ID2 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><select id=\"variant\"><option value=\"0\">① Copper · wall 3 mm</option><option value=\"1\">② Copper · wall 2.2 mm</option><option value=\"2\">③ Stainless · wall 2 mm</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"usage\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Copper <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#9aa3ab\"></span>Stainless <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#1f4e79\"></span>Pilot coil</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Cavity <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></span>Illustrative slider</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"comparison\"><table><thead><tr><th>Configuration</th><th>Cu (kg)</th><th>SS (kg)</th><th>CNY</th><th>Saving</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"note\">Cu: 75,000 CNY/t; SS: 20,000 CNY/t. Shell, end closures, connection tubes and capillaries only. Port openings use projected-area removal. Pilot, slider, seals, joining and processing excluded. Not pressure-qualified.</div></div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // All dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³; prices in CNY/t.\n  bodyOD:34,bodyLength:110,portOD:12.7,portWall:1,portExtension:30,portPitch:22,\n  pilotOD:14,pilotLength:45,pilotY:4,pilotZ:-32,coilLength:20,coilOD:19,\n  capOD:3,capWall:0.5,capRun:18,capDrop:4,capOffset:32,\n  sliderRadius:8,sliderLength:42,pistonRadius:12,pistonThickness:2,\n  copperDensity:8.96,steelDensity:7.90,copperPrice:75000,steelPrice:20000,\n  variants:[{name:'Copper 3 mm',wall:3,steel:false},{name:'Copper 2.2 mm',wall:2.2,steel:false},{name:'Stainless 2 mm',wall:2,steel:true}],\n  radialSegments:80,portSegments:48,capSegments:12,\n  explodeBody:22,explodePorts:15,explodePilot:20\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(100,160,100);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;\n  controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:.85,roughness:.35,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const cu=metal('#b87333'),ss=metal('#9aa3ab'),brass=metal('#c9a227');\n  const coil=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#1f4e79',metalness:0,roughness:.6});\n  const liquid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#3b82f6',transparent:true,opacity:.55,depthWrite:false});\n  const clip=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  const shellMat=cu.clone(),closureMat=cu.clone();\n  let section=false,exploded=false,active=0;\n  let bodyGroup,portGroup,pilotGroup,insideGroup,closureGroup;\n  const capLengthEach=P.capRun+P.capDrop+P.capOffset+P.bodyLength/2+P.capRun-P.pilotLength/2;\n  const capLength=2*capLengthEach;\n  const ringArea=(od,t)=>Math.PI/4*(od*od-(od-2*t)**2);\n  const fixedVolume=4*ringArea(P.portOD,P.portWall)*P.portExtension+ringArea(P.capOD,P.capWall)*capLength;\n  const results=P.variants.map(v=>{\n    const ri=P.bodyOD/2-v.wall;\n    const shellVolume=Math.PI*((P.bodyOD/2)**2-ri**2)*(P.bodyLength-2*v.wall)\n      +2*Math.PI*(P.bodyOD/2)**2*v.wall-4*Math.PI*(P.portOD/2)**2*v.wall\n      -2*Math.PI*(P.capOD/2)**2*v.wall;\n    const copper=(fixedVolume+(v.steel?0:shellVolume))*P.copperDensity/1e6;\n    const steel=(v.steel?shellVolume:0)*P.steelDensity/1e6;\n    return {copper,steel,cost:(copper*P.copperPrice+steel*P.steelPrice)/1000};\n  });\n  window.__metrics=results.flatMap((r,i)=>[\n    {label:P.variants[i].name+' metal usage',value:r.copper.toFixed(4)+' / '+r.steel.toFixed(4),unit:'kg',note:'Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes'},\n    {label:P.variants[i].name+' material cost',value:r.cost.toFixed(2),unit:'CNY',note:'Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t'}\n  ]);\n  document.getElementById('rows').innerHTML=results.map((r,i)=>'<tr><td>'+P.variants[i].name+'</td><td>'+r.copper.toFixed(4)+'</td><td>'+r.steel.toFixed(4)+'</td><td>'+r.cost.toFixed(2)+'</td><td>'+((1-r.cost/results[0].cost)*100).toFixed(1)+'%</td></tr>').join('');\n  function mesh(geometry,material,parent,x=0,y=0,z=0){\n    const m=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);m.position.set(x,y,z);parent.add(m);return m;\n  }\n  function tube(od,id,length,material,parent,position,alongX=false){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();shape.absarc(0,0,od/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,id/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);shape.holes.push(hole);\n    const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n    geo.translate(0,0,-length/2);const m=mesh(geo,material,parent,...position);\n    if(alongX)m.rotation.y=Math.PI/2;else m.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;return m;\n  }\n  function label(text,x,y,z){\n    const c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=128;c.height=64;\n    const ctx=c.getContext('2d');ctx.font='bold 36px Segoe UI';ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillStyle='#25303a';ctx.fillText(text,64,44);\n    const map=new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);\n    const sprite=new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map,depthTest:false}));\n    sprite.position.set(x,y,z);sprite.scale.set(12,6,1);portGroup.add(sprite);\n  }\n  function build(){\n    modelGroup.traverse(o=>{if(o.geometry)o.geometry.dispose();if(o.isSprite){o.material.map.dispose();o.material.dispose();}});\n    modelGroup.clear();\n    bodyGroup=new THREE.Group();closureGroup=new THREE.Group();portGroup=new THREE.Group();\n    pilotGroup=new THREE.Group();insideGroup=new THREE.Group();\n    modelGroup.add(bodyGroup,closureGroup,portGroup,pilotGroup,insideGroup);\n    const v=P.variants[active],r=P.bodyOD/2,ri=r-v.wall;\n    shellMat.color.set(v.steel?'#9aa3ab':'#b87333');closureMat.color.copy(shellMat.color);\n    // Tessellated cylindrical wall, with radial port openings.\n    const positions=[],indices=[],nx=240,nt=P.radialSegments,L=P.bodyLength-2*v.wall;\n    for(let side=0;side<2;side++)for(let i=0;i<=nx;i++)for(let j=0;j<=nt;j++){\n      const a=j/nt*Math.PI*2,rad=side?ri:r;positions.push(-L/2+L*i/nx,rad*Math.cos(a),rad*Math.sin(a));\n    }\n    const stride=(nx+1)*(nt+1);\n    for(let i=0;i<nx;i++)for(let j=0;j<nt;j++){\n      const x=-L/2+L*(i+.5)/nx,a=(j+.5)/nt*Math.PI*2,z=r*Math.sin(a),y=r*Math.cos(a);\n      const centers=y>0?[0]:[-P.portPitch,0,P.portPitch];\n      if(centers.some(cx=>(x-cx)**2+z*z<(P.portOD/2)**2))continue;\n      for(let side=0;side<2;side++){const k=side*stride+i*(nt+1)+j;indices.push(k,k+nt+1,k+1,k+1,k+nt+1,k+nt+2);}\n    }\n    const wall=new THREE.BufferGeometry();wall.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(positions,3));\n    wall.setIndex(indices);wall.computeVertexNormals();mesh(wall,shellMat,bodyGroup);\n    for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n      tube(P.bodyOD,P.capOD,v.wall,closureMat,closureGroup,[sign*(P.bodyLength/2-v.wall/2),0,0],true);\n    }\n    for(const [x,sign,text] of [[0,1,'D'],[-P.portPitch,-1,'E'],[0,-1,'S'],[P.portPitch,-1,'C']]){\n      tube(P.portOD,P.portOD-2*P.portWall,P.portExtension,cu,portGroup,[x,sign*(r+P.portExtension/2),0]);\n      label(text,x,sign*(r+P.portExtension+6),2);\n    }\n    const cavity=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(ri,ri,L,64),liquid,insideGroup);cavity.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    const slider=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.sliderRadius,P.sliderRadius,P.sliderLength,48),brass,insideGroup);slider.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n      const piston=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.pistonRadius,P.pistonRadius,P.pistonThickness,48),brass,insideGroup,sign*P.sliderLength/2);\n      piston.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    }\n    const pilot=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.pilotOD/2,P.pilotOD/2,P.pilotLength,48),ss,pilotGroup,0,P.pilotY,P.pilotZ);pilot.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    const winding=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.coilOD/2,P.coilOD/2,P.coilLength,48),coil,pilotGroup,0,P.pilotY,P.pilotZ);winding.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n      const x=sign*P.bodyLength/2,out=sign*(P.bodyLength/2+P.capRun);\n      const pts=[[x,0,0],[out,0,0],[out,P.capDrop,0],[out,P.capDrop,-P.capOffset],[sign*P.pilotLength/2,P.pilotY,P.pilotZ]];\n      const path=new THREE.CurvePath();\n      for(let i=1;i<pts.length;i++)path.add(new THREE.LineCurve3(new THREE.Vector3(...pts[i-1]),new THREE.Vector3(...pts[i])));\n      mesh(new THREE.TubeGeometry(path,100,P.capOD/2,P.capSegments,false),cu,pilotGroup);\n    }\n    applyView();\n    const m=results[active];document.getElementById('usage').textContent='Cu '+m.copper.toFixed(4)+' kg · SS '+m.steel.toFixed(4)+' kg · '+m.cost.toFixed(2)+' CNY';\n  }\n  function applyView(){\n    shellMat.clippingPlanes=section?[clip]:[];closureMat.clippingPlanes=section?[clip]:[];\n    shellMat.needsUpdate=true;closureMat.needsUpdate=true;insideGroup.visible=section||exploded;\n    bodyGroup.position.z=exploded?-P.explodeBody:0;closureGroup.position.x=exploded?P.explodeBody:0;\n    portGroup.position.y=exploded?-P.explodePorts:0;pilotGroup.position.z=exploded?-P.explodePilot:0;\n    document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';\n  }\n  build();\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(260,26,0xd9d3ca,0xe9e3db);grid.position.y=box.min.y-8;scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const fov=THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(40),lim=Math.min(fov,2*Math.atan(Math.tan(fov/2)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(lim/2)/.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  }\n  fit();\n  const syncRotate=()=>document.getElementById('rotate').textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;syncRotate();});\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{section=!section;applyView();};\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{exploded=!exploded;applyView();};\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;syncRotate();};\n  document.getElementById('variant').onchange=e=>{active=Number(e.target.value);build();};\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;fit();});\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Copper 3 mm metal usage", "value": "0.3598 / 0.0000", "unit": "kg", "note": "Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes"}, {"label": "Copper 3 mm material cost", "value": "26.98", "unit": "CNY", "note": "Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t"}, {"label": "Copper 2.2 mm metal usage", "value": "0.2830 / 0.0000", "unit": "kg", "note": "Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes"}, {"label": "Copper 2.2 mm material cost", "value": "21.23", "unit": "CNY", "note": "Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t"}, {"label": "Stainless 2 mm metal usage", "value": "0.0453 / 0.1917", "unit": "kg", "note": "Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes"}, {"label": "Stainless 2 mm material cost", "value": "7.23", "unit": "CNY", "note": "Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t"}], "suggestions": ["Compare pressure margins using specified refrigerant, design pressure, temperature, and material grades.", "Add realistic pilot internals and animate both refrigerant switching states.", "Include joining, processing, and scrap costs in the three-configuration comparison."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe model represents a four-way reversing valve with a Ø34 × 110 mm main body, an upper D connection, and lower E, S, C connections at 22 mm pitch. A Ø14 × 45 mm pilot assembly connects to both body ends through two Ø3 mm capillaries. Three selectable configurations compare the current 3 mm copper wall, a 2.2 mm copper wall, and a 2 mm stainless wall. Unspecified dimensions are assumed: connection tubes extend 30 mm with 1 mm walls, capillaries have 0.5 mm walls, and end closures match the body wall. Costs include the perforated main shell, end closures, four copper connections, and copper capillaries; pilot internals, joining, and processing are excluded. Sectioning exposes an illustrative cavity and slider, not a validated switching mechanism.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Four-way reversing valve</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#25303a}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:15px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\nbutton,select{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:3px}\n#comparison{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;max-width:540px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;font-size:12px}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}\ntd,th{padding:6px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #dedede}\ntd:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}\n.note{font-size:11px;max-width:490px;margin-top:6px;color:#59616b}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:12px}\n@media(max-width:600px){#comparison{left:12px;font-size:11px}td,th{padding:4px}}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Four-way reversing valve</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Main body Ø34 × 110 mm · E/S/C pitch 22 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">D/E/S/C Ø12.7 · exposed length 30 · wall 1 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Pilot Ø14 × 45 · capillaries Ø3 / ID2 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><select id=\"variant\"><option value=\"0\">① Copper · wall 3 mm</option><option value=\"1\">② Copper · wall 2.2 mm</option><option value=\"2\">③ Stainless · wall 2 mm</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"usage\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Copper <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#9aa3ab\"></span>Stainless <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#1f4e79\"></span>Pilot coil</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Cavity <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></span>Illustrative slider</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"comparison\"><table><thead><tr><th>Configuration</th><th>Cu (kg)</th><th>SS (kg)</th><th>CNY</th><th>Saving</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"note\">Cu: 75,000 CNY/t; SS: 20,000 CNY/t. Shell, end closures, connection tubes and capillaries only. Port openings use projected-area removal. Pilot, slider, seals, joining and processing excluded. Not pressure-qualified.</div></div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // All dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³; prices in CNY/t.\n  bodyOD:34,bodyLength:110,portOD:12.7,portWall:1,portExtension:30,portPitch:22,\n  pilotOD:14,pilotLength:45,pilotY:4,pilotZ:-32,coilLength:20,coilOD:19,\n  capOD:3,capWall:0.5,capRun:18,capDrop:4,capOffset:32,\n  sliderRadius:8,sliderLength:42,pistonRadius:12,pistonThickness:2,\n  copperDensity:8.96,steelDensity:7.90,copperPrice:75000,steelPrice:20000,\n  variants:[{name:'Copper 3 mm',wall:3,steel:false},{name:'Copper 2.2 mm',wall:2.2,steel:false},{name:'Stainless 2 mm',wall:2,steel:true}],\n  radialSegments:80,portSegments:48,capSegments:12,\n  explodeBody:22,explodePorts:15,explodePilot:20\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(100,160,100);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;\n  controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:.85,roughness:.35,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const cu=metal('#b87333'),ss=metal('#9aa3ab'),brass=metal('#c9a227');\n  const coil=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#1f4e79',metalness:0,roughness:.6});\n  const liquid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#3b82f6',transparent:true,opacity:.55,depthWrite:false});\n  const clip=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  const shellMat=cu.clone(),closureMat=cu.clone();\n  let section=false,exploded=false,active=0;\n  let bodyGroup,portGroup,pilotGroup,insideGroup,closureGroup;\n  const capLengthEach=P.capRun+P.capDrop+P.capOffset+P.bodyLength/2+P.capRun-P.pilotLength/2;\n  const capLength=2*capLengthEach;\n  const ringArea=(od,t)=>Math.PI/4*(od*od-(od-2*t)**2);\n  const fixedVolume=4*ringArea(P.portOD,P.portWall)*P.portExtension+ringArea(P.capOD,P.capWall)*capLength;\n  const results=P.variants.map(v=>{\n    const ri=P.bodyOD/2-v.wall;\n    const shellVolume=Math.PI*((P.bodyOD/2)**2-ri**2)*(P.bodyLength-2*v.wall)\n      +2*Math.PI*(P.bodyOD/2)**2*v.wall-4*Math.PI*(P.portOD/2)**2*v.wall\n      -2*Math.PI*(P.capOD/2)**2*v.wall;\n    const copper=(fixedVolume+(v.steel?0:shellVolume))*P.copperDensity/1e6;\n    const steel=(v.steel?shellVolume:0)*P.steelDensity/1e6;\n    return {copper,steel,cost:(copper*P.copperPrice+steel*P.steelPrice)/1000};\n  });\n  window.__metrics=results.flatMap((r,i)=>[\n    {label:P.variants[i].name+' metal usage',value:r.copper.toFixed(4)+' / '+r.steel.toFixed(4),unit:'kg',note:'Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes'},\n    {label:P.variants[i].name+' material cost',value:r.cost.toFixed(2),unit:'CNY',note:'Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t'}\n  ]);\n  document.getElementById('rows').innerHTML=results.map((r,i)=>'<tr><td>'+P.variants[i].name+'</td><td>'+r.copper.toFixed(4)+'</td><td>'+r.steel.toFixed(4)+'</td><td>'+r.cost.toFixed(2)+'</td><td>'+((1-r.cost/results[0].cost)*100).toFixed(1)+'%</td></tr>').join('');\n  function mesh(geometry,material,parent,x=0,y=0,z=0){\n    const m=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);m.position.set(x,y,z);parent.add(m);return m;\n  }\n  function tube(od,id,length,material,parent,position,alongX=false){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();shape.absarc(0,0,od/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,id/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);shape.holes.push(hole);\n    const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n    geo.translate(0,0,-length/2);const m=mesh(geo,material,parent,...position);\n    if(alongX)m.rotation.y=Math.PI/2;else m.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;return m;\n  }\n  function label(text,x,y,z){\n    const c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=128;c.height=64;\n    const ctx=c.getContext('2d');ctx.font='bold 36px Segoe UI';ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillStyle='#25303a';ctx.fillText(text,64,44);\n    const map=new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);\n    const sprite=new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map,depthTest:false}));\n    sprite.position.set(x,y,z);sprite.scale.set(12,6,1);portGroup.add(sprite);\n  }\n  function build(){\n    modelGroup.traverse(o=>{if(o.geometry)o.geometry.dispose();if(o.isSprite){o.material.map.dispose();o.material.dispose();}});\n    modelGroup.clear();\n    bodyGroup=new THREE.Group();closureGroup=new THREE.Group();portGroup=new THREE.Group();\n    pilotGroup=new THREE.Group();insideGroup=new THREE.Group();\n    modelGroup.add(bodyGroup,closureGroup,portGroup,pilotGroup,insideGroup);\n    const v=P.variants[active],r=P.bodyOD/2,ri=r-v.wall;\n    shellMat.color.set(v.steel?'#9aa3ab':'#b87333');closureMat.color.copy(shellMat.color);\n    // Tessellated cylindrical wall, with radial port openings.\n    const positions=[],indices=[],nx=240,nt=P.radialSegments,L=P.bodyLength-2*v.wall;\n    for(let side=0;side<2;side++)for(let i=0;i<=nx;i++)for(let j=0;j<=nt;j++){\n      const a=j/nt*Math.PI*2,rad=side?ri:r;positions.push(-L/2+L*i/nx,rad*Math.cos(a),rad*Math.sin(a));\n    }\n    const stride=(nx+1)*(nt+1);\n    for(let i=0;i<nx;i++)for(let j=0;j<nt;j++){\n      const x=-L/2+L*(i+.5)/nx,a=(j+.5)/nt*Math.PI*2,z=r*Math.sin(a),y=r*Math.cos(a);\n      const centers=y>0?[0]:[-P.portPitch,0,P.portPitch];\n      if(centers.some(cx=>(x-cx)**2+z*z<(P.portOD/2)**2))continue;\n      for(let side=0;side<2;side++){const k=side*stride+i*(nt+1)+j;indices.push(k,k+nt+1,k+1,k+1,k+nt+1,k+nt+2);}\n    }\n    const wall=new THREE.BufferGeometry();wall.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(positions,3));\n    wall.setIndex(indices);wall.computeVertexNormals();mesh(wall,shellMat,bodyGroup);\n    for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n      tube(P.bodyOD,P.capOD,v.wall,closureMat,closureGroup,[sign*(P.bodyLength/2-v.wall/2),0,0],true);\n    }\n    for(const [x,sign,text] of [[0,1,'D'],[-P.portPitch,-1,'E'],[0,-1,'S'],[P.portPitch,-1,'C']]){\n      tube(P.portOD,P.portOD-2*P.portWall,P.portExtension,cu,portGroup,[x,sign*(r+P.portExtension/2),0]);\n      label(text,x,sign*(r+P.portExtension+6),2);\n    }\n    const cavity=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(ri,ri,L,64),liquid,insideGroup);cavity.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    const slider=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.sliderRadius,P.sliderRadius,P.sliderLength,48),brass,insideGroup);slider.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n      const piston=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.pistonRadius,P.pistonRadius,P.pistonThickness,48),brass,insideGroup,sign*P.sliderLength/2);\n      piston.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    }\n    const pilot=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.pilotOD/2,P.pilotOD/2,P.pilotLength,48),ss,pilotGroup,0,P.pilotY,P.pilotZ);pilot.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    const winding=mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.coilOD/2,P.coilOD/2,P.coilLength,48),coil,pilotGroup,0,P.pilotY,P.pilotZ);winding.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n      const x=sign*P.bodyLength/2,out=sign*(P.bodyLength/2+P.capRun);\n      const pts=[[x,0,0],[out,0,0],[out,P.capDrop,0],[out,P.capDrop,-P.capOffset],[sign*P.pilotLength/2,P.pilotY,P.pilotZ]];\n      const path=new THREE.CurvePath();\n      for(let i=1;i<pts.length;i++)path.add(new THREE.LineCurve3(new THREE.Vector3(...pts[i-1]),new THREE.Vector3(...pts[i])));\n      mesh(new THREE.TubeGeometry(path,100,P.capOD/2,P.capSegments,false),cu,pilotGroup);\n    }\n    applyView();\n    const m=results[active];document.getElementById('usage').textContent='Cu '+m.copper.toFixed(4)+' kg · SS '+m.steel.toFixed(4)+' kg · '+m.cost.toFixed(2)+' CNY';\n  }\n  function applyView(){\n    shellMat.clippingPlanes=section?[clip]:[];closureMat.clippingPlanes=section?[clip]:[];\n    shellMat.needsUpdate=true;closureMat.needsUpdate=true;insideGroup.visible=section||exploded;\n    bodyGroup.position.z=exploded?-P.explodeBody:0;closureGroup.position.x=exploded?P.explodeBody:0;\n    portGroup.position.y=exploded?-P.explodePorts:0;pilotGroup.position.z=exploded?-P.explodePilot:0;\n    document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';\n  }\n  build();\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(260,26,0xd9d3ca,0xe9e3db);grid.position.y=box.min.y-8;scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const fov=THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(40),lim=Math.min(fov,2*Math.atan(Math.tan(fov/2)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(lim/2)/.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  }\n  fit();\n  const syncRotate=()=>document.getElementById('rotate').textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;syncRotate();});\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{section=!section;applyView();};\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{exploded=!exploded;applyView();};\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;syncRotate();};\n  document.getElementById('variant').onchange=e=>{active=Number(e.target.value);build();};\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;fit();});\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n<<<METRICS>>>\n[\n  {\"label\":\"Copper 3 mm metal usage\",\"value\":\"0.3598 / 0.0000\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes\"},\n  {\"label\":\"Copper 3 mm material cost\",\"value\":\"26.98\",\"unit\":\"CNY\",\"note\":\"Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t\"},\n  {\"label\":\"Copper 2.2 mm metal usage\",\"value\":\"0.2830 / 0.0000\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes\"},\n  {\"label\":\"Copper 2.2 mm material cost\",\"value\":\"21.23\",\"unit\":\"CNY\",\"note\":\"Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t\"},\n  {\"label\":\"Stainless 2 mm metal usage\",\"value\":\"0.0453 / 0.1917\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"Cu / SS; shell, closures, tubes\"},\n  {\"label\":\"Stainless 2 mm material cost\",\"value\":\"7.23\",\"unit\":\"CNY\",\"note\":\"Cu 75,000; SS 20,000 CNY/t\"}\n]\n<<<SUGGESTIONS>>>\n[\n  \"Compare pressure margins using specified refrigerant, design pressure, temperature, and material grades.\",\n  \"Add realistic pilot internals and animate both refrigerant switching states.\",\n  \"Include joining, processing, and scrap costs in the three-configuration comparison.\"\n]\n<<<END>>>", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 4620, "prompt_tokens": 2470, "total_tokens": 7090, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 2467, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}}, "latency_s": 184.4, "ttft_